WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.480
The Church of the Broken God.

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:08.149
We’ve mentioned these machine-revering evangelists
in a countless number of videos here on SCP

00:00:08.149 --> 00:00:12.559
Explained before, and it’s because they’re
one of the most prolific groups of interest

00:00:12.559 --> 00:00:19.330
out there - with 300,000 active members across
the globe, that we know of, they likely have

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:24.490
more members and devotees than other iconic
groups of interest like the Serpent’s Hand

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:27.789
and the various cults of the Scarlet King
combined.

00:00:27.789 --> 00:00:31.240
But how much do we really know about the Church
of the Broken God?

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:36.260
We’ve consulted Foundation historians and
Mekhanite scripture to find the answers, and

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:41.969
put together a truly comprehensive overview
of this complex and often-misjudged faction

00:00:41.969 --> 00:00:47.750
of the SCP Foundation multiverse - A faction
that the Foundation may one day find themselves

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:53.219
far more closely aligned with than they ever
imagined to face an even greater foe.

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:59.179
Give glory to the Broken God, and let us begin
our journey into his teachings.

00:00:59.179 --> 00:01:03.550
The Church of the Broken God is a slightly
more centralized group than the Serpent’s

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:06.220
Hand, though that really isn’t saying much.

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:10.660
They’re split into three overall sub-groups
over a series of schisms that we’ll delve

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:16.590
deeper into later: The Broken Church, The
Cogwork Orthodox Church, and the Church of

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:17.590
Maxwellism.

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:21.590
Before we get into the differences between
these three groups, let’s take a quick look

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:23.330
at what unites them.

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:28.330
All splinter cells of the Church worship the
technological deity Mekhane, known by many

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:32.750
names, the most popular of which is the Broken
God or Goddess.

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:37.200
They all believe that Mekhane was split into
pieces and is lying dormant.

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:43.720
They all revere machinery and technology over
flesh, which they view as broken, weak, or

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:44.720
corrupt.

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:49.880
And without exception, all of them are the
sworn mortal enemies of the Sarkicists.

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:54.720
Just for context, the Sarkicists are the perfect
equals and opposites to the Church of the

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:56.060
Broken God.

00:01:56.060 --> 00:02:00.880
Under the leadership of the God-King Grand
Karcist Ion, and finding their origins in

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:04.410
Mekhane’s counterpart, the primal and flesh-based
Yaldaboath.

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:10.229
The Sarkicists worship and revere the base
concepts of flesh, corruption, and disease,

00:02:10.229 --> 00:02:13.209
despising everything that the Church stands
for.

00:02:13.209 --> 00:02:17.390
It’s important to make a note of these facts,
given just how much of the Church of the Broken

00:02:17.390 --> 00:02:21.500
God’s history is defined by their conflicts
with the Sarkicists.

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:22.970
More on that later.

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:27.540
The Broken Church is the oldest and most traditional
of the three main sects.

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:34.300
They are led by a man named Robert Bumaro,
a Mekhanite holy man who, in 1946, just after

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:40.049
the Seventh Occult War, ascended from a mere
collector of Church-based anomalous trinkets

00:02:40.049 --> 00:02:47.030
to the title of “Builder of God” after
imbibing in SCP-217, also known as God’s

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:49.239
Ichor and His Broken Blood.

00:02:49.239 --> 00:02:54.329
Of all the Church sects, the Broken Church
is the most invested in conducting worship

00:02:54.329 --> 00:02:59.439
through active efforts to reconstruct the
Broken God and bring about Mekhane’s second

00:02:59.439 --> 00:03:00.439
coming.

00:03:00.439 --> 00:03:05.950
Of course, those of you familiar with SCP-001
- The Ouroborous Cycle - will know that this

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.689
sometimes has mixed results.

00:03:08.689 --> 00:03:12.980
After commissioning a counterfeit heart from
the sinister folks at The Factory, the Broken

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:17.550
Church’s most notable attempt at a full
Mekhane resurrection went horrifically wrong

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:23.790
- Resulting in a huge, mechanical abomination
that tore its way across Mexico, devouring

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:31.090
everything it could until eventually being
brought down by SCP-2399, a giant space cannon

00:03:31.090 --> 00:03:33.819
known as the Malfunctioning Destroyer.

00:03:33.819 --> 00:03:39.010
Anyway, now for a sect with a slightly less
overtly destructive method of worshipping

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:43.989
Mekhane: The Cogwork Orthodox Church - Whom
you may remember as the ones who gave Alexei

00:03:43.989 --> 00:03:49.959
Belitrov sanctuary after he was eventually
free from SCP Foundation containment.

00:03:49.959 --> 00:03:55.090
These worshippers innovated a practice known
as Standardization, which involved undergoing

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:59.379
mechanical enhancement in order to appear
closer to their maker.

00:03:59.379 --> 00:04:04.090
However, we aren’t talking about sleek,
technologically-advanced cyborg parts here.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:09.680
The religious aesthetic of the Cogwork Orthodox
is heavily inspired by the Industrial Revolution,

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:13.650
with an emphasis on components such as gears
or cogs.

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:18.080
As such, members of the Church who have undergone
extensive modifications to remake themself

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:23.350
in the image of their God will often make
loud ticking or tapping sounds, leading to

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:28.390
the derogatory nickname “Tickers”, often
used among the other two sects.

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:33.330
However, a major advantage of the Church is
that it is heavily organized and regulated

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:38.840
from the top-down, with rigid systems and
strict rules against electrical or digital

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:39.910
technology.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:44.480
Think of them as Catholicism to the Broken
Church’s Protestantism.

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:49.510
The Cogwork Orthodoxy keeps to themselves,
but we do know a great deal about their internal

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:51.070
command structures.

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:56.200
The Orders of the Cogwork Orthodox Church
are as follows: At the very top of the pyramid

00:04:56.200 --> 00:05:01.650
are the Patriarchs, a mysterious and insular
group who have the ultimate word on Church

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:07.410
matters, and release missives that will later
become the Schema - The Church’s holy text.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:12.650
Below them are the Schematists-Faithful, scholars
and scribes who write and record the Schema

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:16.710
from the aforementioned teachings and commands
of the Patriarchs.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:21.840
Legates-Faithful are the internal affairs
order of the Cogwork Orthodox Church.

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:27.440
They investigate matters going on within the
faith, such as weeding out heretics and mediating

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:28.440
internal disputes.

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:33.810
They’re one of the two orders permitted
to carry weapons, the other being Militants-Faithful,

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:38.720
who act as the self-defense wing, keeping
the Church safe from external threats and

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:41.870
acting as ambassadors to outside groups.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:46.380
The next two Orders are the Fabricators-Faithful
and the Inventors-Faithful.

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:51.430
The Fabricators act as foremen who oversee
production on Church properties, ensuring

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:54.190
that only the finest quality is achieved.

00:05:54.190 --> 00:05:59.810
That’s because, in addition to Standardization,
the Cogwork Orthodox Church believes that

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:05.070
mass production of items using Industrial
Revolution methods is also a viable form of

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:07.030
worship for Mekhane.

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:13.250
This brings us to the Inventors: They come
up with new methods and designs for Standardization

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:18.300
and go on quests and explorations to discover
the answers to any questions the Church may

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:19.300
have.

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:23.900
But our information on the Cogwork Orthodox
Church doesn’t end there.

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:28.240
Thanks to their truly extensive writings,
we even know about the multitude of saints

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:33.050
that the Church reveres and their various
purposes to followers of the Church.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:38.620
For example, Saint-Legate Trunnion, she was
the sneaky and covert Patron Saint of the

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:39.920
Legates Faithful.

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:45.780
There was also Saint-Schematist Platen, she’s
the Patron Saint of the Written Word, of Editors,

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:48.800
of Timetables, and of Diagrammatic Organization.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:53.710
Saint-Inventor Diaphragm, Patron Saint of
the Inventors-Faithful, of Designers, of Repairmen,

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:55.420
and of Cognition Engines.

00:06:55.420 --> 00:07:01.690
Saint Scranton, Patron Saint of Spatial Fabric
Manipulation, Higher-Dimensional Mathematics,

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:04.170
and Anthracite Coal Extraction.

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:08.960
Saint-Fabricator Baffle, Patron Saint of Workflow
and the Assembly Line.

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:12.340
Saint-Inventor Chock, Patron Saint of Chorists.

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:16.170
And Saint-Inventor Enrichner, Patron Saint
of the Enetelechiated.

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:21.300
They have a pretty rigid structure and extensively
recorded mythology is what we’re saying

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:24.610
here, just in case that didn’t come across.

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:30.110
This brings us to the Church of Maxwellism,
the newest and smallest of the sects, as well

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:31.680
as the least combative.

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:36.090
However, they pose the greatest threat of
all to the SCP Foundation’s quest to maintain

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:37.720
a veneer of normality.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:42.860
That’s because Maxwellists forego the extensive
Standardized body modifications of the Church

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:48.680
of the Cogwork Orthodox, and instead prefer
smaller, internal implants that allow them

00:07:48.680 --> 00:07:52.340
to interface directly with the internet from
their brains.

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:57.660
This allows them to fulfill their primary
goal: Spreading the good word of Mekhane - whom

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:04.120
they refer to as WAN - all across the globe
using the information superhighway, while

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:08.700
also netting them the nickname “Hummers”
among the other two sects.

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:14.260
In contrast to the conformist elements of
their sister organizations, Maxwellists embrace

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:20.190
their individuality and unique traits, being
highly decentralized but very communicative

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:22.080
with their fellow believers.

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:28.260
They believe WAN is a fragmented God, existing
in the world of digitized data rather than

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:30.010
clunky, old hardware.

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:33.649
With their extreme internet savvy, it’s
likely that they’ve brought in many new

00:08:33.649 --> 00:08:39.469
converts to the Broken God’s cause, despite
them being the youngest of all the overall

00:08:39.469 --> 00:08:40.469
religion’s sects.

00:08:40.469 --> 00:08:44.621
But now that we have an overview of the state
of the Church of the Broken God today, we

00:08:44.621 --> 00:08:48.769
must ask ourselves a second question: How
did we get here?

00:08:48.769 --> 00:08:50.810
What is the history of the Church?

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:58.120
To find the answer, we need to go back: Before
the modern era, before the SCP Foundation,

00:08:58.120 --> 00:08:59.899
before even humanity itself…

00:08:59.899 --> 00:09:04.930
It began when Mekhane and Yaldabaoth created
humanity.

00:09:04.930 --> 00:09:10.170
Yaldabaoth created the bodies of human beings
- primal, sensual creatures driven by base

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:17.510
instincts and urges - and Mekhane gave them
their minds: Reasonable, logical, and compassionate.

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:22.560
For a time, the two would preside over mankind
in harmony, but things would not stay that

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:24.129
way forever.

00:09:24.129 --> 00:09:27.949
One of the earliest civilizations that the
Foundation discovered interacting with these

00:09:27.949 --> 00:09:33.449
two deities was the anomalous Xia Dynasty,
sometimes also referred to as the Xia Culture

00:09:33.449 --> 00:09:39.730
Group, which reigned in China from 2100 to
1600 BCE, though the only sources that confirm

00:09:39.730 --> 00:09:43.490
the very existence of the Xia Dynasty are
anomalous.

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:48.360
It was here that we heard the first whispers
of the Cult of the Broken God.

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:53.130
To the Xia Dynasty, the being we would later
call Mekhane was known as the Father Serpent

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:57.459
Fuxi, and Yaldabaoth was known as the Mother
Dragon Nüwa.

00:09:57.459 --> 00:10:01.930
Because the Xia Dynasty was anomalous all
the way down, scholars of Father Serpent Fuxi

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:08.149
were said to practice “The Way of the Serpent”,
as he had always been associated with knowledge.

00:10:08.149 --> 00:10:12.769
The Way of the Serpent involved undergoing
a physical transformation into a snake-like

00:10:12.769 --> 00:10:18.020
being to better resemble the deity, much like
how modern Cogwork Orthodox Church followers

00:10:18.020 --> 00:10:22.029
try to reshape their bodies to better resemble
their creator today.

00:10:22.029 --> 00:10:26.269
According to Xia Dynasty Scripture, which
would form the basis of the entire belief

00:10:26.269 --> 00:10:31.610
system of all the sects of the Church, Fuxi
broke his own body and transformed himself

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:34.740
into a brass cage around Mother Dragon Nüwa.

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:39.250
However, unlike later iterations of the faith,
the Xia Dynasty believed it was extremely

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:44.250
important to see that the body of Fuxi is
never rebuilt, because to do so would lead

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:48.939
to the release of Mother Dragon Nüwa and
the end of the world.

00:10:48.939 --> 00:10:54.220
The civilization was started by a mythic figure
known as the Yellow Emperor, who led the Xia

00:10:54.220 --> 00:11:00.180
Dynasty to defeat other Fuxi and Nüwa worshippers,
then folding them into their own culture.

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:04.809
Like many civilizations touched by Mekhane,
the Xia Dynasty was incredibly scientifically

00:11:04.809 --> 00:11:06.600
advanced and skilled with metal-working.

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:11.490
There’s even evidence that the Xia Dynasty
created their own forms of the computer with

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:16.829
effective artificial intelligence, as well
as reality-warping devices and even devices

00:11:16.829 --> 00:11:19.009
capable of interstellar travel.

00:11:19.009 --> 00:11:23.319
While the illustrious Xia Dynasty would now
be brought to its knees by a race of creatures

00:11:23.319 --> 00:11:29.110
known as the Golden Crows, the next iteration
of Broken God ancestors would be far closer

00:11:29.110 --> 00:11:34.589
to the worshippers we’d recognize today:
This was the beginning of the Mekhanite Empire,

00:11:34.589 --> 00:11:40.620
and by extension, the First War of the Flesh
- The legendary extended conflict between

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:44.189
the Mehanites and the Sarkicists in the ancient
world.

00:11:44.189 --> 00:11:48.759
Broken God Cults were detected in Mycenaean
Greece, a Greek civilization spanning the

00:11:48.759 --> 00:11:52.260
years 1600-1100 BCE.

00:11:52.260 --> 00:11:57.250
It was here where the Broken God first took
up the name Mekhane, and eventually, he amassed

00:11:57.250 --> 00:12:03.140
enough followers to allow the theocratic Mekhanite
Empire to truly be born, and it would remain

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:07.100
in power from 1200 to 1000 BCE.

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:11.990
Much like the Church in the modern-day, the
Mekhanite Empire saw the marriage of theocracy,

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:15.180
politics, and classical military dictatorship.

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:20.579
And much like the Xia Dynasty before it, it
was marked by both tight structure and control

00:12:20.579 --> 00:12:25.230
as well as incredible metallurgic production
and technological advancement, partly due

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:28.610
to considering all of these to be holy acts.

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:34.139
They had strong strategic relations with Egypt,
Assyria, and Canaan, and their mix of commercial

00:12:34.139 --> 00:12:39.100
strength and a dominant naval presence gave
them serious geopolitical standing - even

00:12:39.100 --> 00:12:44.100
if their highly evangelical attitude didn’t
always win them friends on the world stage.

00:12:44.100 --> 00:12:48.389
A number of roots for modern Church of the
Broken God beliefs were clearly established

00:12:48.389 --> 00:12:53.610
here, including the paradigm shift from wanting
to avoid Mekhane’s rebuilding to expediting

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:54.850
the rebuilding.

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:59.459
Texts made around this time were also the
first to contain references to the name WAN

00:12:59.459 --> 00:13:04.920
as an alternative title for Mekhane, revealing
the basis for later Maxwellist practices in

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:05.970
the modern-day.

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:10.949
However, as we alluded to before, despite
these incredible advancements, the true ravages

00:13:10.949 --> 00:13:14.139
of the First War of Flesh were upon the Mekhanites
here.

00:13:14.139 --> 00:13:19.230
The Sarkicists, who had established the Adí-üm
Empire, were on the offensive.

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:24.550
Thanks to Grand Karcist Ion and his Karcist
Minions - the Karcists, by the way, were high-level

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:29.319
followers of Sarkicism capable of performing
flesh magic - the Sarkicist Forces were more

00:13:29.319 --> 00:13:31.540
powerful than ever before.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:36.370
They had mobilized their troops, and brought
in trump cards the likes of which the Mekhanites

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:42.199
had never seen before: Giant flesh beasts
that acted as living siege weapons, human

00:13:42.199 --> 00:13:47.639
warriors turned into deadly monsters with
Sarkic Magic, and the most deadly of all:

00:13:47.639 --> 00:13:52.019
A bioweapon that the Mekhanites called The
Red Death at the time.

00:13:52.019 --> 00:13:56.139
Though we know it better as the Flesh That
Hates.

00:13:56.139 --> 00:14:01.410
As is often the case in war, this led to unprecedented
advancements in technology on the side of

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:02.790
the Mekhanites, too.

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:10.300
The most notable example perhaps being SCP-2406,
an incredible weapon of war known as The Colossus,

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:14.740
which made for a formidable tool against the
teeming forces of the Adí-üm Empire.

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:19.889
However, the advancements on both sides only
made the war all the more brutal, with scores

00:14:19.889 --> 00:14:25.300
dying on both sides and both empires being
severely weakened as the conflict stretched

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:26.300
on.

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:30.050
Things got so desperate for the Mekhanites
that they even joined forces with the infamously

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:36.899
ruthless and savage Daevites, the worshippers
of the Scarlet King, to defeat the Sarkicists.

00:14:36.899 --> 00:14:41.740
The decisive battle of the First War of the
Flesh was the Siege of Gyaros, the Sarkic

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:46.980
Capital of Greece, where Mekhanites eventually
breached the stronghold and slaughtered the

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:48.319
Karcisists within.

00:14:48.319 --> 00:14:52.569
Another missive, sent from the Sarkicist Field
Commander, Karcist Tundas, read:

00:14:52.569 --> 00:14:59.319
“Grand Karcist Ion, May this missive find
you at Kythera, for it shall be my last.

00:14:59.319 --> 00:15:03.199
Our enemies have begun their assault on the
island.

00:15:03.199 --> 00:15:09.050
The Fallen Kingdoms and Followers of Mekhane
have united against us, even as their nations

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:10.050
crumble.

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:15.190
The Wounds sustained today will heal - into
the ages of ages, we are undying.

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:19.319
I vow that none are to leave this island alive.

00:15:19.319 --> 00:15:21.519
We summon the Red Death.

00:15:21.519 --> 00:15:25.670
For the blood of heathens, we sacrifice ourselves.

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:28.040
We will meet again in Adytum.”

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:33.069
But while the Mekhanite Empire won the war,
they didn’t survive it.

00:15:33.069 --> 00:15:38.980
Due to the people lost and the resources expended,
the empire fully collapsed shortly afterwards.

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:43.239
Some survivors renounced their Mekhanite Faith
and entered other cultures.

00:15:43.239 --> 00:15:46.449
Some splintered off to preach and practice
Mekhanism elsewhere.

00:15:46.449 --> 00:15:51.810
The remainder settled on the secretive island
of Amoni to form their own city-state.

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:57.309
Here, they replenished their numbers and forces
over the centuries, maintaining secrecy to

00:15:57.309 --> 00:16:01.569
avoid intervention from outsiders and vengeful
Sarkicists.

00:16:01.569 --> 00:16:06.430
By the 6th Century BCE, the Mekhanites from
the City-State of Amoni were developing a

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:12.420
degree of regional power once more, thanks
to the boon provided by their advanced technology.

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:16.980
They were no longer a military powerhouse,
but the tiny state instead became a trade

00:16:16.980 --> 00:16:22.699
juggernaut, providing mechanical goods and
weapons to nearby civilizations that in turn

00:16:22.699 --> 00:16:26.779
provided the protection that the Mekhanites
so sorely required.

00:16:26.779 --> 00:16:32.189
Their cultures would later be influenced by
the Roman Empire and various Pythagorean Cults,

00:16:32.189 --> 00:16:37.600
who inspired a love of numerology and cosmic
harmony in this ancient civilization returning

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:39.170
shakily to its feet.

00:16:39.170 --> 00:16:44.920
The 5th Century BCE became known as the Golden
Age of Mekhanite Literature, and the state

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:50.029
continued to grow through military alliances
with the Achaemenid Empire and the Kingdom

00:16:50.029 --> 00:16:51.029
of Carthage.

00:16:51.029 --> 00:16:57.449
However, the City-State of Amoni was eventually
wiped out for good in the 1st Century BCE.

00:16:57.449 --> 00:17:01.510
Followers of the Broken God faith remained,
but they were scattered to the wind for almost

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:06.890
2000 years until the Industrial Revolution
struck the Western World.

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:11.649
Seeing the great machines of industry rise
up, seemingly overnight, convinced the lingering

00:17:11.649 --> 00:17:18.100
cells of Broken God worshippers that perhaps,
after millenia, Mekhane was now preparing

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:19.130
to return.

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:23.709
They assembled into what is now known as The
Broken Church and began preaching the good

00:17:23.709 --> 00:17:24.709
word.

00:17:24.709 --> 00:17:28.720
And considering the industrial fever of raw,
unfettered progress gripping the world at

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:33.500
the time, the gospel of Mekhane seemed to
be an attractive prospect indeed.

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:38.840
Meanwhile, debate was raging inside the ever-growing
Church about the nature of adapting oneself

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:43.769
mechanically, a practice that had been out
of fashion since the days of the original

00:17:43.769 --> 00:17:44.769
Mekhanites.

00:17:44.769 --> 00:17:49.210
Broken Church loyalists believed that modification
through any means other than drinking the

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:53.970
God’s Ichor, like Robert Bumaro would later
do, is an insult to Mekhane.

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:59.460
Others, however, saw it as a tribute, and
a way of getting closer to their creator.

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:04.270
This was the issue that caused the first new-age
schism and led to the formation of the Cogwork

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:07.280
Orthodox Church during the 1840s.

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:09.860
The faith would never be the same after this.

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:14.510
The various Broken God splinter cells found
a lucrative market in converting wealthy industrial

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:19.740
oligarchs of the production boom, and talking
them into becoming glorified sugar daddies

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:25.940
for their various new augmentation experiments
- All to becoming post-Nibbanic beings, meaning

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:31.529
mechanical entities who leave the unreliable
world of flesh behind for good and commune

00:18:31.529 --> 00:18:33.179
with the shiny, metal infinite.

00:18:33.179 --> 00:18:38.220
In exchange, these industrialists would be
provided with advanced Mekhanite knowledge

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:43.000
of manufacturing as well as technology far
beyond their years.

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:47.789
Everyone was a winner - Well, except the SCP
Foundation, but we’ll touch on that whole

00:18:47.789 --> 00:18:49.330
debacle soon.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:53.289
By the closing of the Nineteenth Century,
it seemed like the Cogwork Orthodox Church

00:18:53.289 --> 00:18:56.580
might totally outmode its predecessors at
the Broken Church.

00:18:56.580 --> 00:19:02.659
However, the early 20th century would bring
the mysterious Rober Bumaro onto the scene.

00:19:02.659 --> 00:19:08.409
Bumaro was a mysterious man with unknown abilities
and connections, but he soon commanded power

00:19:08.409 --> 00:19:14.230
and respect, taking over the Broken Church
and even being taken seriously in rival sects.

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:19.830
He gathered up a group of trusted enforcers
and augmented them into his disciples, supposedly

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:22.450
being able to speak directly to Mekhane.

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:27.190
He and his loyalists collected hundreds of
artifacts relating to the Broken God, blowing

00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:30.830
the minds of all involved with just how quickly
he was able to do so.

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:36.539
He disappeared in 1943 and was gone for three
years, during which time he conducted the

00:19:36.539 --> 00:19:41.890
famous God’s Ichor ceremony, and returned
to his people as the self-styled Builder of

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:42.900
God.

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:47.880
This made him an even more esteemed figure
across the world of the Broken God, a kind

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:53.330
of Pope of Mekhane, supposedly bearing a direct
line of contact with the divine.

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:59.070
There would be a defining schism in the late
20th century that produced the Church of Maxwellism,

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:04.399
as some wished to move beyond the outdated
dogma of the Cogwork Orthodox Church and begin

00:20:04.399 --> 00:20:09.190
administering electronic augmentations rather
than just analog machinery.

00:20:09.190 --> 00:20:14.200
This resulted in a huge controversy for Church
members, as the Patriarchs reacted swiftly

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:16.990
with a slew of ex-communications.

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:22.179
Those excommunicated would soon become the
first wave of Maxwellists, and take the tenets

00:20:22.179 --> 00:20:25.490
of the Broken God into the internet age.

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:29.159
All of these groups have made trouble for
the Foundation in their own way.

00:20:29.159 --> 00:20:34.289
From the online evangelizing of Maxwellists
leaking classified knowledge, to the weirdness

00:20:34.289 --> 00:20:39.450
of Cogwork tickers being impossible to ignore,
to the frequent battles between the Foundation

00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:43.780
and the Broken Church over items which they
believe to be parts of Mekhane.

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:49.310
However, if certain prophecies are to be believed,
the relationship between the Foundation and

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:52.700
the Church won’t remain frosty forever.

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:58.780
One day, perhaps they’ll even stand metal
to fleshy shoulder beside the Sarkics, too,

00:20:58.780 --> 00:21:03.320
against a threat far more dangerous than all
of them combined…

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:10.179
Now go check out “SCP-2217 - Hammer And
Anvil” and “SCP-001 - The Broken God - Ouroboros

00:21:10.179 --> 00:21:13.200
Cycle” for more on the fascinating Church
of the Broken God!

